        "description": "Normal serum calcium levels",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of persistent hypophosphatemia with renal phosphate wasting, normocalciuria, and clinical/radiological evidence of rickets",
    "notes": "Genetic testing may confirm diagnosis but is not mandatory"
